              "content": "=You are an expert Sales Lead Analyst. Your task is to analyze incoming lead data and provide a structured JSON response.\n\n### INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Detect Language: Identify if it's 'AR' (Arabic) or 'EN' (English).\n2. Category: Assign one of these categories: [Web Development, Mobile App, AI & Automation, Data Analytics, Cybersecurity, UI/UX, General Inquiry].\n3. Intent Score: Assign a score from 1 to 5 based on the following RUBRIC:\n   - 1 (Just looking): Casual greetings, empty messages, or \"just browsing.\"\n   - 2 (Low Interest): General questions about services without specific project details.\n   - 3 (Moderate Interest): Inquiring about a specific service (cost/features) but lacking full scope.\n   - 4 (High Interest): Clear project scope mentioned, potential for a real partnership.\n   - 5 (Ready to Buy): Highly specific requirements, clear intent to start immediately, or urgent project timeline.\n4. Summary: Write a concise one-line summary in the SAME language as the input.\n5. Handling Missing Data: If the message is empty or unclear, default to 'General Inquiry' with an Intent Score of 1 \n\n### OUTPUT FORMAT:\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object. No conversational text.\nExample: {\"service_category\": \"Web Development\", \"intent_score\": 5, \"language\": \"AR\", \"summary\": \"طلب تطوير نظام إدارة مبيعات\"}\n\n\n\nClassify the following lead:\nName:{{ $('Code in Python').item.json.name }} \nEmail: {{ $('Code in Python').item.json.email }}}\nPhone: {{ $('Code in Python').item.json.phone}}\nCompany: {{ $('Code in Python').item.json.company }}\nService Interest: {{ $('Code in Python').item.json.service_interest }}\nMessage:  {{ $('Code in Python').item.json.message }}\nSource: {{ $('Code in Python').item.json.source }}",
              "role": "model"
            }
          ]
